Apple is only allowing customers in the United States to purchase a maximum of two iPhone Duos. Attempting to purchase more than two on the website or the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-store/">Apple Store</a> app gives the following notice: "A maximum of 2 <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> can be purchased per customer. Please adjust the total quantity of &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; in your order before checking out."<br/>
