<a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/iPhoneDuo/comments/1xa7qxc/apple_now_warns_of_a_2_iphone_duo_limit_per/">Some Reddit users</a> describe the U.S. purchase limit as new, but we couldn't confirm if it was in place when pre-orders started on October 16. The Reddit thread has reports from customers claiming to have been able to purchase four Duos and from those who say they were limited to two.<br/>
